            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3117",
            "content": {
                "en": "You’re welcome. I actually have things to do around here, so I might need your help again later.",
                "zh": "不客气，我在这附近正好有事要做，或许一会还得来找你帮忙也说不定。",
                "ja": ""
